#: ../../source/docs/sitl-i2c-devices.rst:27 ff6977bd5a8a46f2af80dd7e223e350b
msgid ""
"i2c devices vary in the structure of the on-wire protocol.  Some examples of"
" protocol shapes include:"
msgstr "I2C 设备的线上协议结构各不相同。协议形式的一些示例包括："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-i2c-devices.rst:29 d3239b7316ea45959f00cc139805b4e0
msgid ""
"simply stream bytes onto the i2c bus; when a read is attempted from one of "
"these devices a response is received with bytes filled in, regardless of "
"what transfer is made to the device.  SIM_Airspeed_DLVR is an example of an "
"implementation of this sort of device, never allowing i2c writes to the "
"device and always returning 4 bytes of data."
msgstr ""
"直接向 I2C 总线流式传输字节；从这类设备读取时，无论向设备发送什么数据，都会收到带有填充字节的响应。SIM_Airspeed_DLVR "
"是此类设备实现的示例，它不允许 I2C 写入，并始终返回 4 字节数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-i2c-devices.rst:31 faa77eea0d8f45d09a5c51ff86d1bb85
msgid ""
"respond to a simple i2c \"take reading command\" by making available a "
"reading on a subsequent i2c read transaction.  The SIM_MaxSonarI2CXL is an "
"example of this sort of device, responding to a command of 0x51 by taking a "
"measurement and allowing a subsequent read of 2 bytes to return that "
"measurement."
msgstr ""
"响应简单的 I2C「开始测量命令」，在后续的 I2C 读事务中提供测量结果。SIM_MaxSonarI2CXL 是此类设备的示例，它响应 0x51 "
"命令进行测量，并允许后续读取 2 字节以返回该测量值。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-i2c-devices.rst:33 a5834b5fe8f24437b5417e3997e1b405
msgid ""
"a register-based interface where the ArduPilot driver writes to registers at"
" specific offsets to configure the device and reads data back via the same "
"interface.  i2c transactions are usually a pair of couple transactions, one "
"to specify the registers to read and the other for the simulated device to "
"return the data.  The simulated IS31FL3195 LED driver is an example of this,"
" presenting a number of control registers used for setting the LED patterns "
"and device behaviour.  These i2c devices often have a \"WHOAMI\" register to"
" determine the device type.  SMBus devices also often speak this protocol, "
"but using 16-bit registers rather than the usual 8-bit."
msgstr ""
"基于寄存器的接口，ArduPilot 驱动通过写入特定偏移处的寄存器来配置设备，并通过同一接口读取数据。I2C "
"事务通常是一对操作，一个用于指定要读取的寄存器，另一个用于仿真设备返回数据。仿真的 IS31FL3195 LED "
"驱动器就是这种设备的示例，它提供了一些用于设置 LED 模式和设备行为的控制寄存器。这类 I2C "
"设备通常有一个「WHOAMI」寄存器用于确定设备类型。SMBus 设备也通常使用此协议，但使用 16 位寄存器而非通常的 8 位。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-i2c-devices.rst:36 2181ff33dfd744eb9d9036ba75a5693e
msgid "Choosing a Device Style"
msgstr "选择设备类型"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-i2c-devices.rst:38 577a7a4dbc9e4fef8a85e533edb003a2
msgid ""
"When implementing a new simulator, care must be taken to choose the correct "
"\"style\" of simulator to implement.  Several base classes can be inheritted"
" from to prevent warrantless duplication.  As always, find a good example of"
" something similar to the device you wish to simulate and \"do what that "
"thing does\".  Working out what the protocol is requires study of the "
"datasheet for the device."
msgstr ""
"在实现新仿真器时，必须谨慎选择正确的仿真器「类型」来实现。可以继承几个基类以避免无意义的重复。与往常一样，找到与您想仿真的设备相似的好示例，「照着做」。弄清楚协议需要研究设备的数据手册。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-i2c-devices.rst:40 4635781b8a5e417680fe82e8789eaacf
msgid ""
"For devices which are strictly register-based, the ``I2CRegisters_8Bit`` (or"
" ``I2CRegisters_16Bit``) base class should be inheritted from.  This allows "
"your new simulator to describe the registers present on the device, and "
"simply fill the register values in based on how ArduPilot manipulates other "
"registers.  It is also possible to create simulates devices with both 8 and "
"16 bit registers - see ``I2CRegisters_ConfigurableLength``"
msgstr ""
"对于严格基于寄存器的设备，应继承 ``I2CRegisters_8Bit`` （或 "
"``I2CRegisters_16Bit``）基类。这允许您的新仿真器描述设备上存在的寄存器，并根据 ArduPilot "
"操作其他寄存器的方式简单地填充寄存器值。也可以创建同时具有 8 位和 16 位寄存器的仿真设备——参见 "
"``I2CRegisters_ConfigurableLength``。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-i2c-devices.rst:42 abca029cbed841869e8e6f0f8c75a181
msgid ""
"For devices which are polled to start some sort of measurement and "
"subsequently make available a 16-bit quantity for reading "
"``I2CCommandResponseDevice`` may be used to write a simple driver."
msgstr "对于通过轮询触发某种测量并随后提供 16 位读取量的设备，可使用 ``I2CCommandResponseDevice`` 编写简单驱动。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-i2c-devices.rst:44 b1cbdff6a398421b9e271c4ac33ab442
msgid ""
"For devices which simply return fixed-length readings when an i2c \"read\" "
"is made - and for any other protocol which doesn't yet have an abstraction -"
" your simulation will need to implement the virtual method "
"``rdwr(I2C::i2c_rdwr_ioctl_data *&data)`` inheritted from SITL::I2CDevice."
msgstr ""
"对于在 I2C「读」时简单返回固定长度读数的设备，以及任何尚无抽象的其他协议，您的仿真需要实现从 SITL::I2CDevice 继承的虚方法 "
"``rdwr(I2C::i2c_rdwr_ioctl_data *&data)``。"
